そう！ハアリングの人、あのMIO先輩のハアリングを作ってるCGマンに響いてよ。マイハアリングの作ってる方なのじゃ。うん。すごい好きで、すごい好きだから歌っていこうと思いますのじゃ。
Yeah! Hauring's person -- MIO-senpai's Hauring producer CGman resonates with this! The creator of my Hauring, noja. Yeah. I love it so much, I love it so much, so I'm going to sing it, noja.

163
00:24:52,730 --> 00:25:01,730
そうグルグル回すやつ！サビでぐるぐる回すやつのじゃ！お主らサビでさ、ぐるぐるのコメントして！お主らサビ、
Yeah, the spinning thing! The one you spin round and round in the chorus, noja! You guys, in the chorus, post spinning comments! You guys, in the chorus,

164
00:25:02,152 --> 00:25:05,472
わしらサビでグルグルのコメントしてほしいのじゃ
I want you guys to post "guruguru" comments during the chorus, you see.

165
00:25:07,552 --> 00:25:08,192
よし
Alright.

166
00:25:09,892 --> 00:25:12,652
じゃあ歌っていこうと
So I'm going to sing...

167
00:25:14,852 --> 00:25:16,412
思いまーすのじゃ！
...now, you see!

168
00:25:16,552 --> 00:25:20,472
そのグルグルじゃないのじゃ、まぁいいよ。伝わればいいのじゃ、伝わればいいですのじゃ。
Not that kind of "guruguru," oh well. As long as it gets across, that's fine, you see.

169
00:25:21,532 --> 00:25:24,472
よいしょよいしょ、歌っていきますのじゃ！
Heave-ho, I'll keep on singing, you see!

170
00:25:36,574 --> 00:25:41,474
Let's look for sparkling daydream...

171
00:25:41,474 --> 00:25:43,294
ゲットしよう Sparkling Daydream
Get it, Sparkling Daydream

172
00:25:47,994 --> 00:25:56,334
しばらく見つめ合ってから そらすまでに何を考えてたの？
After staring at each other for a while, what were you thinking before looking away?

173
00:25:57,774 --> 00:26:06,214
気になる唇 尖らせた私をみて「どうしたの？」って聞いてくるの
You see me pouting with my curious lips and ask, "What's wrong?"

174
00:26:06,214 --> 00:26:13,814
待ってみるのごまかしたあとのひとりごとは 恥ずかしいから
When I try waiting, my mumbling after brushing it off is so embarrassing,

175
00:26:13,814 --> 00:26:19,134
聞かないでくれる？
so won't you pretend you didn't hear?

176
00:26:19,994 --> 00:26:29,774
あとに引けないほど惹かれ合う恋 もう始まってた
A love pulling us so deep we can't turn back has already begun!

177
00:26:31,014 --> 00:26:38,234
夢ならたくさん見た 覚めたままでもまだ会いたい
I've dreamed of this so much, even awake I still want to see you.

178
00:26:38,234 --> 00:26:47,614
君がそうさせた 恋は欲張りだね 飛び跳ねそうな心の 欲くままにゆこうよ
You made me this way, love is so greedy. With a heart feeling like it's leaping out, let's follow our desires!

179
00:26:47,614 --> 00:26:59,174
理想も妄想も現実も 全て君を中心に回る 新しい世界へ
Ideals, delusions, and reality—everything revolves around you into a brand new world!

180
00:26:59,174 --> 00:27:05,614
Looking so crazy...

181
00:27:06,514 --> 00:27:17,894
偶然聞こえた誰かの声が もう一度聞けた時 必然を信じた
When I heard someone's voice by chance and heard it once more, I believed in destiny.

182
00:27:18,934 --> 00:27:31,174
そんなとき言葉には意味はなくて 体が動く 君を探して 痛みねじ伏せるように現実逃避
At a time like that, words lose their meaning, and my body moves searching for you, escaping reality as if suppressing the pain.

183
00:27:31,174 --> 00:27:48,794
でもそこに君が現れて 臆病な私すら抱きしめてくれた 虹がかかる朝
But right there you appeared and embraced even timid little me on a morning where a rainbow spans across.

184
00:27:48,794 --> 00:28:01,494
綺麗な空見上げて 君とかける夢見るの 明日もそうだよ
Looking up at the beautiful sky, dreaming of running with you—tomorrow will be the same!

185
00:28:01,494 --> 00:28:21,034
恋は終わらない 同じ星に生まれた こんなチャンス他にない 運命と宿命が巡る 魔法にかかってるような 輝く奇跡へ
Love never ends. Born under the same star, there's no other chance like this. To a shining miracle, like being under a spell woven by fate and destiny!

186
00:28:24,066 --> 00:28:26,566
Sparkling Daydream大好きなのじゃー！
I love Sparkling Daydream, you see!

187
00:28:34,554 --> 00:28:49,454
理想と妄想と現実も 違おうよで同じなんだ 形にはできないけれど
Ideals, delusions, and reality might seem different, but they're the same! Though they can't take physical form,

188
00:28:49,454 --> 00:28:59,694
どれも大切と悟るの 瞳が夜 忘れない
I realize how precious they all are. My eyes won't forget the night.

189
00:28:59,694 --> 00:29:07,054
夢ならたくさん見た 覚めたままでもまだ会いたい
I've dreamed of this so much, even awake I still want to see you.

190
00:29:07,054 --> 00:29:28,614
君がそうさせた 恋は欲張りだね 飛び跳ねそうな心の 欲くままにゆこうよ 理想も妄想も現実も 全て君を中心に回る 新しい世界へ
You made me this way, love is so greedy. With a heart feeling like it's leaping out, let's follow our desires! Ideals, delusions, and reality—everything revolves around you into a brand new world!

191
00:29:39,066 --> 00:29:41,066
のじゃー！
Noja!

192
00:29:45,066 --> 00:29:52,066
ありがとうございますのじゃ！Sparkling Daydreamなのじゃ。
Thank you very much, you see! That was Sparkling Daydream.

193
